<title>CHINA: China Jan-June crude oil imports up 32.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June crude oil imports up 32.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 14.42 million tonnes of crude oil in January-June, a rise of 32.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-JUNE     JUNE	   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Oil     14.42 million    2.71 million	 +32.8</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-JUNE     JUNE	   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>	   10.23 million    1.78 million	 +20.1</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
